#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:5
#: 5ee46b4123b74a769745479ca18c72b6
msgid "ESP32 WiFi telemetry - DroneBridge"
msgstr "ESP32 WiFi 数传 - DroneBridge"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:7
#: a24f53401fb84c1fadd4d530c4fa71b5
msgid ""
"ESP32 are readily available Wi-Fi modules with full TCP/IP stack and "
"microcontroller capability. They offer dedicated UART, SPI and I2C "
"interfaces."
msgstr "ESP32 是随手可得的 WiFi 模块，具有完整的 TCP/IP 协议栈和微控制器能力，提供专用的 UART、SPI 和 I2C 接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:11
#: 1e76b75fd9374a939cc4bfee4087b3de
msgid ""
"**DroneBridge for ESP32** for the popular ESP32 modules from Espressif "
"Systems offers a transparent and bi-directional serial  to WiFi bridge. In "
"addition it features a custom ESP-NOW implementation which allows for ranges"
" of up to 1km. It is one of the cheapest ways to communicate with ardupilot "
"wirelessly."
msgstr ""
"**DroneBridge for ESP32** 专为 Espressif Systems 的热门 ESP32 模块打造，提供透明的双向串口转 "
"WiFi 桥接。此外，它还具有自定义 ESP-NOW 实现，通信距离可达 1km。这是与 ArduPilot 进行无线通信最经济实惠的方式之一。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:13
#: 302bbc1deaa74c91a14b5bc75c99758f
msgid ""
"It also allows for a fully transparent serial to WiFi pass-through link with"
" variable packet size.| DroneBridge for ESP32 is a telemetry/low data rate-"
"only solution. There is no support for cameras connected to the ESP32 since "
"it does not support video encoding."
msgstr ""
"它还支持可变数据包大小的完全透明串口转 WiFi 直通链路。| DroneBridge for ESP32 "
"是一种仅适用于数传/低速数据传输的解决方案，不支持连接到 ESP32 的摄像头，因为它不支持视频编码。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:-1
#: 07389729d6184a6ba545de55a46c345a
msgid "DroneBridge for ESP32 and WiFi connections"
msgstr "DroneBridge for ESP32 与 WiFi 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:18
#: a0a4ea510fcf4f4ab7626b90d7c55c3c
msgid ""
"DroneBridge for ESP32 supports standard WiFi connections to an access point "
"but can also operate as a standalone access point."
msgstr "DroneBridge for ESP32 支持连接到标准 WiFi 接入点，也可以作为独立热点运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:-1
#: 090f2efd581746e398970245963924cb
msgid "DroneBridge for ESP32 using ESP-NOW for drone swarms"
msgstr "DroneBridge for ESP32 使用 ESP-NOW 支持无人机集群"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:23
#: 21225e7a00d14ba7ad11cec7cca27987
msgid ""
"The ESP-NOW mode offers a connectionless and encrypted alternative to "
"traditional WiFi. While the data rate is reduced to ~250 kbit/s the range is"
" increased up to 1 km. This mode has no limit on how many clients are "
"connected on the autopilot side. Only channel capacity and processing "
"capacity limit the number of clients. This mode requires ESP32 devices on "
"the GCS side as well as on the autopilot side."
msgstr ""
"ESP-NOW 模式提供了一种无连接且加密的传统 WiFi 替代方案。数据速率降至约 250 kbit/s，但通信距离可达 "
"1km。此模式对飞控侧连接的客户端数量没有限制，仅受信道容量和处理能力限制。此模式要求地面站侧和飞控侧均使用 ESP32 设备。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:28
#: 8093d0cd0ee249769e445ae5a5e8f1dc
msgid "Features"
msgstr "功能特性"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:30
#: 93c894fade0e429c8d27c824aaff8c63
msgid ""
"Bidirectional: serial-to-WiFi, serial-to-WiFi Long-Range (LR), serial-to-"
"ESP-NOW link"
msgstr "双向：串口转 WiFi、串口转 WiFi 长距离（LR）、串口转 ESP-NOW 链路"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:31
#: 9b1bb69ecfbe42c3a3a95980898b2b4d
msgid ""
"Support for MAVLink, MSP, LTM or any other payload using transparent option"
msgstr "支持 MAVLink、MSP、LTM 或使用透明模式的任何其他数据格式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:32
#: eab8842fbbf1486a946c9eb7548be362
msgid "Affordable, Reliable & low latency"
msgstr "经济实惠、可靠、低延迟"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:33
#: 052c8314ec334eac8cc06c90be0ed97f
msgid "Weight: <8 g"
msgstr "重量：< 8g"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:34
#: 00e17f66cf444399aae8a32bdbc5f617
msgid "Up to 150m range using standard WiFi"
msgstr "使用标准 WiFi 时通信距离可达 150m"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:35
#: 1fba4b617f554d76944b4fd2bc736f0a
msgid ""
"Up to 1km of range using ESP-NOW or Wi-Fi LR Mode - sender & receiver must "
"be ESP32 with LR-Mode enabled"
msgstr "使用 ESP-NOW 或 WiFi LR 模式时通信距离可达 1km——发送端和接收端均须为启用 LR 模式的 ESP32"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:36
#: 783ffe1b8005426ba996934a669e5d5e
msgid ""
"Fully encrypted in all modes including ESP-NOW broadcasts secured using AES-"
"GCM 256 bit!"
msgstr "所有模式（包括使用 AES-GCM 256 位加密的 ESP-NOW 广播）均完全加密！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:37
#: 524372112bbc4da8836d350960e6ad35
msgid "Supported by: QGroundControl, Mission Planner, mwptools, impload etc."
msgstr "支持：QGroundControl、Mission Planner、mwptools、impload 等"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:38
#: 775f85637cc940e98d9b194d05e41958
msgid ""
"Easy to set up: Power connection + UART connection to flight controller"
msgstr "设置简便：连接电源 + 连接飞控 UART 即可"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:39
#: 84ee3d37e6c94190b1875e28ca728bdc
msgid "Fully configurable through an easy-to-use web interface"
msgstr "通过易用的 Web 界面进行完整配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:40
#: 3663639e0dfe4615a5aea4371faed58a
msgid ""
"Parsing of LTM & MSPv2 for more reliable connection and less packet loss"
msgstr "解析 LTM 和 MSPv2 以提高连接可靠性并减少丢包"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:41
#: c10ee69ca83147bbaa5ad00d3570fd16
msgid ""
"Parsing of MAVLink with the injection of Radio Status packets for the "
"display of RSSI in the GCS"
msgstr "解析 MAVLink 并注入 Radio Status 数据包，以在地面站中显示 RSSI"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:42
#: 28c73ae713dd4818be314b5ee5b90811
msgid "Fully transparent telemetry down-link option"
msgstr "完全透明的数传下行链路选项"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:43
#: 0c3bfaba9f78470da99a8d80b5b20439
msgid ""
"Support for drone swarms of almost any size using ESP-NOW with its custom & "
"encrypted broadcast mode"
msgstr "使用 ESP-NOW 的自定义加密广播模式，支持几乎任意规模的无人机集群"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:46
#: 978da723adf24b17838f1ae35745a713
msgid "Recommended Hardware"
msgstr "推荐硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:48
#: 9b9d3bf98b054fa3bd0f977fb1c85c74
msgid ""
"Every ESP32 board is capable of running DroneBridge for ESP32. Boards and "
"modules with an external antenna connector are recommended, since those will"
" likely offer more range."
msgstr ""
"每款 ESP32 开发板都可以运行 DroneBridge for "
"ESP32。建议使用带有外置天线接头的板卡和模块，因为这类设备通常可以提供更远的通信距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:52
#: 7cd11be612c04419b67575835336ef35
msgid ""
"Most modules support 3.3V input (only), while some autopilots serial ports "
"provide 5V . You will need to check compatibility and step down the voltage "
"if needed. It is not generally recommended to use the autopilot's 3.3V "
"supply unless you are certain it can provide enough current for the ESP32 "
"board you are using."
msgstr ""
"大多数模块仅支持 3.3V 输入，而部分飞控的串口提供 5V。您需要检查兼容性，并在必要时进行降压处理。一般不建议使用飞控的 3.3V "
"供电，除非您确认其能为所使用的 ESP32 板卡提供足够的电流。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:55
#: 55de1c574d224c8381921aa4764c48b2
msgid "Officially Supported and Tested Boards"
msgstr "官方支持并经过测试的开发板"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:57
#: 7c68e8e6ad464769a1b3e74e61dd5a40
msgid ""
"Do the project and yourself a favour and use one of the officially supported"
" and tested boards below. These boards are very low in price, have "
"everything you need and are also very small. Perfect for use on any drone."
msgstr "为了项目顺利进行，建议使用以下官方支持并经过测试的开发板。这些开发板价格低廉、功能完备且体积小巧，非常适合安装在任何无人机上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:60
#: 385b1e6f44634cc88cdf15238990c3ba
msgid ""
"`You can find all the latest information on the official boards on the "
"website.`_"
msgstr "`您可以在官网上找到关于官方开发板的所有最新信息。`_"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:64
#: ed8f7b37a1c24d94830c0cf7fd6c9f83
msgid "Downloading and Flashing the Firmware"
msgstr "下载和烧录固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:66
#: 063af45a142e4fb1a1e9a78efe5e4113
msgid ""
"An easy-to-use online flashing tool is available on the official website. "
"Just connect your ESP32 and click flash! `For more detailed information "
"please visit the official Wiki!`_"
msgstr "官方网站提供了一个易于使用的在线烧录工具。只需连接您的 ESP32 并点击烧录即可！`更多详情请访问官方 Wiki！`_"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:71
#: 26b6abb1c2254a5a9058d6929cf0346a
msgid "Configuring DroneBridge for ESP32"
msgstr "配置 DroneBridge for ESP32"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:73
#: c78b12cee6484d32b084baf7ea85baea
msgid ""
"You can change the default configuration via the Web Interface. Connect to "
"the ESP32 via WiFi and enter ``dronebridge.local``, "
"``http://dronebridge.local`` or ``192.168.2.1`` in the address bar of your "
"browser."
msgstr ""
"您可以通过 Web 界面更改默认配置。通过 WiFi 连接到 ESP32 后，在浏览器地址栏中输入 "
"``dronebridge.local``、``http://dronebridge.local`` 或 ``192.168.2.1``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:-1
#: 9ce2cb065c2440a49341d6c6d4a9aeee
msgid "DroneBridge for ESP32 Webinterface"
msgstr "DroneBridge for ESP32 Web 界面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:81
#: d53428e07797447d9f2cdd61b3324722
msgid "Wiring"
msgstr "接线"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:83
#: c210c2fc7b8d4ff499fe86d15222de74
msgid ""
"Wiring is very simple and mostly the same for all devices connected to any "
"serial port (ie. TELEM1 or TELEM2) of the autopilot. This guide does not go "
"into detail here but provides an outline for wiring below."
msgstr "接线非常简单，连接到飞控任意串口（如 TELEM1 或 TELEM2）的方式基本相同。本指南不作详细介绍，但提供以下接线概述。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:87
#: 252ba0fab5ea491389397c5b764390ed
msgid ""
"Connect UART of ESP32 to a UART of your autopilot (ie. TELEM 1 or TELEM 2 "
"port). Make sure the voltage levels match! Most ESP32 DevKits can only take "
"3.3V!"
msgstr ""
"将 ESP32 的 UART 连接到飞控的某个 UART（如 TELEM 1 或 TELEM 2 端口）。请确保电压电平匹配！大多数 ESP32 "
"开发板仅支持 3.3V！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:91
#: 85986ff5cd4241349f9f262aa32c1214
msgid "TX to RX"
msgstr "TX 接 RX"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:92
#: 3bceabd3430b4c059b89c008a9b74920
msgid "RX to TX"
msgstr "RX 接 TX"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:93
#: 75ad52bd77184bb591729fcf1f69fcb6
msgid "GND to GND"
msgstr "GND 接 GND"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:94
#: e3bc5a0fa9a64a3583dae3319210f7e6
msgid ""
"Stable 3.3V or 5V power supply to the ESP32 (depending on the available "
"inputs of your ESP32 and capabilities of the autopilot)"
msgstr "为 ESP32 提供稳定的 3.3V 或 5V 电源（取决于您的 ESP32 可用输入和飞控的供电能力）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:97
#: 766a0a315c3148159c491c7e7e5e66f4
msgid "Set the autopilot port to MAVLINK 1 or 2 protocol."
msgstr "将飞控端口设置为 MAVLink 1 或 2 协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:99
#: 18ed201104bd42dabeefd9cd8f5aad68
msgid ""
"Some manufacturers of ESP32 DevKits have the wrong labels for the pins on "
"their products. Make sure that the PINs on your board are labeled correctly "
"if you encounter issues."
msgstr "部分 ESP32 开发板制造商的产品引脚标注有误。如果遇到问题，请确认板卡上的引脚标注是否正确。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:101
#: 754e5e8c54174b329b945f94a9a0a876
msgid ""
"Make sure to always follow the instructions of the ESP32 board manufacturer "
"when it comes to wiring. Especially the power supply."
msgstr "请务必遵循 ESP32 开发板制造商的接线说明，特别是电源部分。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:-1
#: 1bc9efccd9934ce0bb0b4829c3922b2f
msgid "Example wiring of autopilot to ESP32"
msgstr "飞控与 ESP32 接线示例"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:108
#: 34fdcd7fc72747de8c0eb60a83bcb822
msgid "ArduPilot configuration"
msgstr "ArduPilot 配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:110
#: 6cc92e22ee4f49ea9a2344e8b71819d2
msgid ""
"Configure the UART of the autopilot that is wired to the ESP32 to have "
"matching baud rates and MAVLink set as protocol for optimal performance."
msgstr "为获得最佳性能，配置与 ESP32 相连的飞控 UART，使其波特率匹配，并将 MAVLink 设置为协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:112
#: 6de5f6c7ee2a4192aad84087e41e5064
msgid ""
"for example, if connected to SERAIL2 port on the autopilot these parameters "
"should be set:"
msgstr "例如，如果连接到飞控的 SERIAL2 端口，应设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:114
#: b6ec8ea2e19c4317b6e0f8441c9c4b48
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 2 (MAVLink2) or 1 (MAVLink1)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 2（MAVLink2）或 1（MAVLink1）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:115
#: bf392a191c5449bdb2c4ba516cc65dd4
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115 (115200 baud)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115（115200 波特率）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:117
#: a1050fd9c8374cd5b86101cd50ea0f9d
msgid ""
"If you have problems connecting, it may help to set :ref:`BRD_SER2_RTSCTS "
"<BRD_SER2_RTSCTS>` = 0 to disable flow control although this is not normally"
" necessary"
msgstr ""
"如果连接遇到问题，可以尝试将 :ref:`BRD_SER2_RTSCTS <BRD_SER2_RTSCTS>` = 0 以禁用流控，虽然通常不必要"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:121
#: 4bf5ca7e3d0d4a63ac0ad9a6c9f07d4c
msgid "Connection to the GCS"
msgstr "连接到地面站"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:123
#: 1a3a46f2d8f74d4a807c602c9c4bb1e2
msgid "The following connection options are available:"
msgstr "以下连接方式可供选择："

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:125
#: e1ae5a088f9a439f9a3b61bc4e14c4c7
msgid "UDP unicast on port ``14550`` to all connected devices."
msgstr "通过 UDP 单播将数据发送到所有连接设备的 ``14550`` 端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:126
#: 74b80524e69f407fa043ceb5e1d08d25
msgid "TCP on port ``5760``"
msgstr "TCP 端口 ``5760``"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:128
#: 0e7c3ae564f149d7a2936270f690a48d
msgid ""
"DroneBridge for ESP32 will automatically forward all data to all connected "
"WiFi devices via UDP to port 14550. QGroundControl or Mission Planner should"
" auto-detect the connection and no further actions should be necessary."
msgstr ""
"DroneBridge for ESP32 将通过 UDP 自动将所有数据转发到所有连接的 WiFi 设备的 14550 "
"端口。QGroundControl 或 Mission Planner 应能自动检测连接，无需进一步操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:134
